Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.39,0:00:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.93,0:00:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.53,0:00:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.11,0:01:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,your horn freaks may have\Nwon control on the field
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.67,0:01:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,but now it's time to\Nsee if you can hold it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.25,0:01:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,track it on battle gone\Ngive that car to bashing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.09,0:01:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,whoa look at them glow\Nthose guys are some kind
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.53,0:01:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,of tag team wow you're\Nright about that the power
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.79,0:01:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,bonus they gain from\Nboth being on the field
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.57,0:01:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,at the same time makes\Nthem a tough duo to beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.05,0:01:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.96,0:01:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And since Joey's already taken out Rex's\Nbest monster card, the rest will be cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.23,0:01:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Finish him, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.61,0:01:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.52,0:01:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Who said that Serpent Knight Dragon Joey\Ndestroyed two turns ago was my best card?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.91,0:01:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,My supreme monster is a dragon, but of a
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.49,0:01:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,different sort.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.65,0:01:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The Red Eyes Black Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.03,0:01:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,A what dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.21,0:02:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,your pair of primates can power up\Ntill they're green in the face there's
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.89,0:02:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,still no match for the thrashing\Npower of this beast so it does exist
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.79,0:02:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,my grandpa told me about this card\Nits powers are said to rival those
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.07,0:02:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,of the legendary blue eyes white dragon\Nit's about time rex played a card
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.49,0:02:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,that'll put joey in his place and\Nif you think those brain-dead brutes
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.05,0:02:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,of yours will rescue each other from\Nthis dragon's rampage think again
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.71,0:02:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,with dragon nails my red eyes gets a\Npower boost strong enough to clobber
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.61,0:02:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,an army of your battle guards red\Neyes black dragon inferno fire blast
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.37,0:02:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,how could he torch them\Nboth with just one shot
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.05,0:02:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,those who defend together\Nare destroyed together
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.77,0:02:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you thought\Ntheir little clubs would
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.73,0:02:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,be enough to save them\Nfrom my dragon's wrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.03,0:03:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That creep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.81,0:03:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a good boy, Rex. Nice work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.13,0:03:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you smell that odor in the air, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.37,0:03:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the stench of your\Ndefeated battle guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.87,0:03:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's up next for the roast?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.29,0:03:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.81,0:03:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.73,0:03:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, tell me that dragon\Nisn't as tough as it looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.31,0:03:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, there must be something\NJoey can do to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.53,0:03:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I wish I could answer her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.51,0:03:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Because there is one last move that\Ncould save Joey from that red eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.93,0:03:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm barred from giving\Nadvice in this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.47,0:03:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's going to have to figure\Nout this one all by himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.27,0:03:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Play every monster you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.11,0:03:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,My dragon has enough\Nfirepower to turn your
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.29,0:03:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,whole deck into a smoldering pile of ash.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.91,0:03:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Rex is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.97,0:03:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No creature I have can\Nout-muscle that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.45,0:03:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I guess this is where I get my\Nbutt handed to me. Yo, Joey! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.11,0:03:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You may not have the monster to beat\Nthat thing, but you got the smarts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.39,0:03:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not giving up on you, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.15,0:03:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget, dueling's more\Nabout heart than strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.13,0:04:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now show this lizard what you're made of.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.87,0:04:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's it, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.55,0:04:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Slap down another card\Nfor my red eyes to fry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.25,0:04:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.69,0:04:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey still has his time wizard\Nout from a few turns ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.75,0:04:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the card he played to\Nclobber Mai and her harpies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.59,0:04:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,With Yugi's help, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.03,0:04:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Shame Joey's too much of an amateur\Nto know how to use it himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.81,0:04:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you going to nab\Nme the victory you promised,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.17,0:04:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,or are you going to sit there\Nwith that dumb look on your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.83,0:04:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Again with the insults?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.31,0:04:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to wreck that arrogant\Nattitude of hers in our duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.91,0:04:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.82,0:04:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If I could snag Joey's time wizard, it\Nwould be the perfect way to shut her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.23,0:04:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,She can't win against that card.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.35,0:04:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.75,0:04:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.21,0:04:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make this duel\Nmore exciting and each
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.17,0:04:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,put one card up for grabs\Nwith our star chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.69,0:04:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And just so it's fair, we'll both put\Nup whatever card we have on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.35,0:04:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sound good? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.79,0:04:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have any cards on the...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.33,0:04:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, my time wizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.99,0:05:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.29,0:05:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And for him, I'll give you my rarest card.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.05,0:05:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The Supreme Red-Eyes Black Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.61,0:05:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what do you think you're\Ndoing, you disobedient dolt?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.53,0:05:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You're here to take Joey out of this\Ntournament, not to improve your deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.55,0:05:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.46,0:05:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Chris, you double-crossing snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.95,0:05:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what you're scheming.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.79,0:05:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm no lousy snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.33,0:05:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a dinosaur.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.24,0:05:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You know that! Ha! You're no...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.31,0:05:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That red-eyes black dragon\Ncould really help my chances at
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.51,0:05:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,winning this tournament and getting\Nits prize money for my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.17,0:05:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But I hate to risk this time Wizard Yugi\Ngave me like it was some bargaining chip.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.43,0:05:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.67,0:05:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.45,0:05:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.45,0:05:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You got a deal, Rex.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.15,0:05:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Red-Eyes Dragon and my Time\NWizard. Winner takes all. What? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.61,0:05:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a gutsy move, Sacker.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.25,0:05:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But while I'm at it, Rex, I'm\Nmaking him my weapon of choice, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.83,0:05:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Go Time Wizard!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.37,0:05:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.49,0:06:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey just figured out the best\Npossible move for this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.95,0:06:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This wouldn't be happening if\Nyou just obeyed my commands, Rex.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.85,0:06:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you packed your bags, Rex.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.87,0:06:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Because if my Time Wizard spin\Narrow lands on a Time Wolf,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.07,0:06:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll be on the next\Nboat off this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.17,0:06:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really want to leave this\Nentire duel up to a single spin?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.07,0:06:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You do know what'll happen if that\Narrow lands on a skull, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.11,0:06:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hits or risk, I gotta take.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.79,0:06:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Time, roulette, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.47,0:06:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What happens if the\Narrow lands on a skull?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.79,0:06:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll self-destruct and take a\Nchunk out of Joey's life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.73,0:06:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.64,0:06:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,All he's got is a chunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.65,0:06:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,i can't believe this\Nentire duel has come down
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.27,0:06:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,to one spin it's almost\Ntoo nerve-wracking to
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.95,0:06:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,even watch all we can do\Nnow is hope that arrow
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.27,0:06:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,doesn't land on a skull\Nokay then let's start
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.63,0:07:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,open.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.54,0:07:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, time machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.19,0:07:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, skull.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.65,0:07:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's stopping. Slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.35,0:07:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Joe! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.45,0:07:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, time warp, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.41,0:07:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Time magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.45,0:07:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.53,0:07:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Look what you've done!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.09,0:07:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The entire space-time continuum\Nis speeding out of control!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.13,0:07:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Eons are passing like seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.69,0:07:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,he's been fossilized\Nno he hasn't he's still
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.01,0:07:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,standing sure he's\Nbeginning to gray a little
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.21,0:07:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,but that's natural go\Non and have him attack
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.63,0:08:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,rex go on rex right uh\Nred eyes go on and attack
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.69,0:08:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.51,0:08:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The millions of years that\NJoey's time wizard made pass
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.53,0:08:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,has turned Rex's dragon into\Na brittle shell of dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.63,0:08:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So I guess you won my star chips, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.99,0:08:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.41,0:08:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only did I win you star chips, but\NI won you red eyes too, fair and square.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.73,0:08:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And he did it all by himself too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.37,0:08:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.93,0:08:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.95,0:08:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're the man, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.71,0:08:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.91,0:08:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming right at you, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.67,0:08:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me some skin, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.01,0:08:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Up high or down low?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.87,0:08:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you're down low, bud. You...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.35,0:08:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,you shoved me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.51,0:08:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,After everything I just went\Nthrough, you go and shoved me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.43,0:08:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, tough to Molly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.15,0:08:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we're even for when you push me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.35,0:08:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know two wrongs\Ndon't make a right, you jerk?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.05,0:09:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I make it three, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.49,0:09:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.40,0:09:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.31,0:09:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to fight over this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.85,0:09:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we ought to stay\Nout of this one I think
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.17,0:09:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,this is their bizarre way\Nof showing each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.07,0:09:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They care.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.98,0:09:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay I just hope they\Ndon't care about me that much
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.47,0:09:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy it sure got dark in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.55,0:09:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, maybe we ought to set up camp\Nsomewhere Don't tell me you're afraid Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.93,0:09:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You got us protecting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.59,0:09:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but who's protecting you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.03,0:09:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.51,0:09:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's set up camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.21,0:09:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.89,0:09:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing in these woods\Nbut crickets and squirrels.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.33,0:09:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And when they finally pulled over to look
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.71,0:09:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,and see what was in the\Nbackseat of the car,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.85,0:09:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,it was over 20 pepperoni pizzas with\Ndouble cheese and meatballs. Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.47,0:09:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of ghost story\Nis that supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.97,0:09:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't get some food in me, I'm\Ngoing to be turning into a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.03,0:10:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Toast two in their stomachs, huh, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.55,0:10:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, my meal ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.49,0:10:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.43,0:10:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Wild mushrooms are poisonous, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.63,0:10:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So do us all a favor and let him eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.03,0:10:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what do you want, Mai?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.53,0:10:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.44,0:10:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You can duel me, you can insult me,\Nbut you're not eating in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.45,0:10:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're that hungry, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.09,0:10:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, then, give me your star\Nchips and I'll give you some food.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.25,0:10:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.16,0:10:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Potato chips, I mean,\Nstar chips are priceless!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.47,0:10:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just kidding, Joseph.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.51,0:10:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be more than happy to share if you can\Nmanage to ask politely like a gentleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.03,0:10:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.94,0:10:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So then you can go make\Nfun of me for that, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.17,0:10:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.08,0:10:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,by tomorrow I'll have one\Nentrance to the castle,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.95,0:10:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,so there's no point in me keeping\Nan entire knapsack full of food.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.67,0:10:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It sure would be nice not to have to\Nduel tomorrow on an empty stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.37,0:10:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,How do we know this isn't another trick?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.13,0:10:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me just one good reason to trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.13,0:11:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it's either me or\Nthat poisonous mushroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.79,0:11:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at all this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.07,0:11:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Candy bars?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.98,0:11:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Dibs on the candy bars.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.89,0:11:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Potato chips?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.81,0:11:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Dibs on the chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.23,0:11:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Canned fruit?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.14,0:11:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Soda?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.05,0:11:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Dibs on the soda.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.97,0:11:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.88,0:11:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No dibs on anything yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.79,0:11:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,At least not until you\Ncomplete your chores.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.09,0:11:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I want Yugi to go look for some firewood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.37,0:11:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.28,0:11:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And you two boys can go\Nand fetch us some water.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.73,0:11:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.79,0:11:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,If she's not slinging insults,\Nthen she's barking orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.47,0:11:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm willing to swallow my pride\Nif it means swallowing some food.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.95,0:11:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go and gather us up that firewood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.85,0:11:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.39,0:11:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your name? Taya, is it? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.45,0:11:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Taya, if you want\Nto freshen up a bit,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.35,0:11:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,there's a makeshift\Nshower just over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.87,0:11:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.78,0:11:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hanging out with those boys is no\Nreason to have to smell like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.65,0:11:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, I don't think we\Nshould cook the candy bars.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.69,0:11:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.60,0:11:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.51,0:11:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai sure is a hard gal to read.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.27,0:11:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,One minute she's starting trouble with\Nus, and the next we're sharing a campfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.99,0:11:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at you go, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.43,0:11:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Only thing missing is a chef's hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.05,0:12:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And a cute apron.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.01,0:12:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez, all right already.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.99,0:12:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Now keep cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.31,0:12:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You're tough, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.63,0:12:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Us gals have got to\Nlook out for each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.95,0:12:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,especially with a bunch\Nof bozos like them around.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.61,0:12:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't see why you even\Nbother hanging out with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.31,0:12:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's easy, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.59,0:12:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,They're my best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.17,0:12:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Those goofballs?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.39,0:12:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,In my experience, their type is only\Ngood for moving furniture or fixing cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.27,0:12:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mai?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.91,0:12:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.09,0:12:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard something moving\Naround right outside. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.03,0:12:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.15,0:12:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, it sure smells good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.93,0:12:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to dig in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.01,0:12:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.07,0:12:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, thank you very much.\NNot bad. How's yours, Taya?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.39,0:12:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Four stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.91,0:12:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of stars, I hear\Nyou've won a few, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.45,0:12:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,How many do you have? Eight?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.39,0:12:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Or is it nine?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.63,0:12:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,However many, it sure sounds\Nlike you're in the zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.31,0:12:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.87,0:12:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think you're going to fool me\Nwith your nice guy routine, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.93,0:13:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time before you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.57,0:13:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't we just forget about\Nthe tournament for one night?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.25,0:13:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make fun of Joey instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.01,0:13:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's always fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.15,0:13:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, just as long as everyone is\Ncrystal clear about one little thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.69,0:13:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Any duelist in my way is going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.83,0:13:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.33,0:13:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, if you'll excuse me,\NI'm going to go for a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.75,0:13:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.61,0:13:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, she can really ruin a meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.51,0:13:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I should never have sat\Ndown with those losers,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.05,0:13:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,even if they do seem like kind\Nof nice losers and friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.55,0:13:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And no, I can't afford to go soft now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.99,0:13:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a duelist first, and that\Nmeans everyone is an enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.35,0:13:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So no friends for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.05,0:13:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to win, and I'll do it all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.37,0:13:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.53,0:14:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fading fast here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.33,0:14:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think we should check on Mai?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.05,0:14:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.97,0:14:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,She has been gone for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.97,0:14:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's probably some trap. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.65,0:14:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.95,0:14:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.86,0:14:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Bet you she's been waiting\Nthere the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.35,0:14:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on out, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.45,0:14:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Akura. See? I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.37,0:14:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't just been seeing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.97,0:14:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing way out here, Bakura?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.11,0:14:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Same as you guys, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.79,0:14:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You gave us a scare sneaking\Naround those bushes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.27,0:14:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, for a minute there, we actually\Nthought we had something to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.35,0:14:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty silly, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.13,0:14:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, you've been staring at\Nthat card for like an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.75,0:14:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.71,0:14:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you, just don't laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.77,0:14:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes, when I'm in a duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.79,0:14:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I pretend that it's me\Nout there on the field
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.29,0:14:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,swapping blows with whatever\Ncard my opponent has out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.65,0:14:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that dumb?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.13,0:14:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if you were, which card\Nwould you want to be, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.01,0:15:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.83,0:15:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The Flame Swordsman\Nkicks everybody's butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.79,0:15:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Not my guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.33,0:15:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The Cyber Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.15,0:15:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You boys and your cards are hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.39,0:15:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I think everyone has a card\Nthey can identify with.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.83,0:15:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You should see if you can\Npick one for yourself, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.01,0:15:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.92,0:15:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I picked this one,\NMagician of Faith. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.65,0:15:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.05,0:15:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,More like the Magician\Nof Freaks, if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.55,0:15:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.79,0:15:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me which one you identify with, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.59,0:15:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.75,0:15:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magician, hands down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.11,0:15:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm just out of the loop,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.73,0:15:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,but don't you guys think\Nit's a little silly
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.41,0:15:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,to be comparing ourselves\Nto playing cards?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.87,0:15:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe a little, but\Nit's like Grandpa says.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.57,0:15:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not about the playing cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.93,0:15:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,it's about putting a little bit of your\Nheart into anything that you care about,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.59,0:15:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.11,0:15:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So which card do you\Ncare about most, Bakura?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.59,0:15:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This one is my favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.89,0:15:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that the change of heart card?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.05,0:15:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Kind of a weird-looking\Npicture, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.77,0:15:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.68,0:16:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to see how it works,\Nwe could have a duel right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.79,0:16:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Not for star chips, just for a little fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.81,0:16:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.72,0:16:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm down with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.63,0:16:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,After all the star chip stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.13,0:16:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,it'll be nice to have a duel\Nwith no strings attached.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.93,0:16:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.99,0:16:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I think just a regular old\Nduel sounds like a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.13,0:16:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you guys each\Nput your favorite card
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.25,0:16:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,into Yuki's deck so it'll\Nbe like we're all playing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.31,0:16:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a good idea. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.49,0:16:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Great, but I should warn you that\Nwith this all-star team of cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.91,0:16:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll be tough to beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.33,0:16:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,True, but maybe I'll surprise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.59,0:16:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This'll be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.37,0:16:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm all shuffled.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.37,0:16:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're sure you\Ndon't mind playing alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.77,0:16:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry about a thing, Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.01,0:16:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll go easy on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.23,0:16:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.61,0:16:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's get this duel on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.79,0:16:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Before we get started, there's a little\Nsomething I'd like to share with you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.97,0:16:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.88,0:16:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And especially with you,\NYugi. What's that? You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.45,0:16:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.27,0:17:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,This is getting freaky.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.21,0:17:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.85,0:17:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,A Millennium Item.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.31,0:17:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and the magic of my Millennium\NRing will take us to the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.01,0:17:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I hate magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.23,0:17:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this, Bakura?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.07,0:17:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You've something I want,\NYugi, and I aim to take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.63,0:17:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That wasn't too difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.55,0:17:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Their souls have been locked away, and\Nnow, after waiting for countless centuries,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.47,0:17:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,the legendary Millennium Puzzle is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.61,0:17:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.52,0:17:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.07,0:17:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You want my Millennium Puzzle?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.27,0:17:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you're going to\Nhave to duel me for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.73,0:18:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I win, you'll release my\Nfriends and send us all back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.51,0:18:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree to your ridiculous\Nterms, Yugi, but I promise you,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.63,0:18:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,there is more at stake\Nhere than you comprehend,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.31,0:18:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,and this is one shadow\Ngame that you cannot win!
